WEBVTT

00:01:00.309 --> 00:01:03.642
In my dreams I fantasize

00:01:03.666 --> 00:01:07.241
of wreaking vengeance on you guys.

00:01:07.265 --> 00:01:10.740
Say your motorcycle crashes.

00:01:10.764 --> 00:01:14.071
Blood comes gushing from your gashes.

00:01:14.095 --> 00:01:20.678
With your fading strength, you call 9-1-1
and you pray for a trained MD.

00:01:20.702 --> 00:01:22.322
But you get me.

00:01:22.346 --> 00:01:23.789
(Laughter)

00:01:23.813 --> 00:01:28.011
And you listen to the sounds of silence.

00:01:28.035 --> 00:01:30.924
(Music)